<title>ROMANIA: TENNIS-NETHERLANDS BEAT ROMANIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NETHERLANDS BEAT ROMANIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Netherlands beat Romania 3-2 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup tennis World Group, first round tie after</p>
<p>winning both the reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>results (Romania names first):</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea lost to Jan Siemerink  6-7 (6-8) 7-5 7-6 (7-3) 6-7</p>
<p>(8-10) 4-6</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel lost to Paul Haarhuis 3-6 1-6 2-6</p>
</text>
